Dialogue: 99,0:00:29.92,0:00:32.02,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,It's yours. Today's dinner.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:33.75,0:00:34.52,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 99,0:00:34.79,0:00:36.57,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,He got me good.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:36.57,0:00:37.55,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 99,0:00:38.79,0:00:41.45,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,Yeah. It'll heal right away, after all.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:42.89,0:00:45.11,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,Whew, I'm beat.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:45.69,0:00:46.43,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 99,0:00:53.03,0:00:54.75,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,Oh, he's back.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:59.25,0:01:00.13,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,Welcome back.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:00.85,0:01:01.76,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,How'd it go?
Dialogue: 99,0:01:02.17,0:01:05.03,Default,Asakaze,0,0,0,,I went as far as I could go, but there's nothing out there.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:05.03,0:01:08.77,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,Nothing out there?\N No islands, no boats, no land masses?
Dialogue: 99,0:01:08.77,0:01:10.35,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,Nothing man-made?
Dialogue: 99,0:01:10.35,0:01:11.27,Default,Asakaze,0,0,0,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:11.91,0:01:14.71,Default,Asakaze,0,0,0,,Just the same ocean,\N extending forever in every direction.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:16.67,0:01:19.57,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,We're not home yet.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:20.41,0:01:21.76,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 99,0:01:21.76,0:01:24.66,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,That we're still not back in our original world.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:25.33,0:01:27.65,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,Just like when the school was enveloped in darkness,
Dialogue: 99,0:01:27.65,0:01:30.19,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,we're in yet {\i1}another{\i0} world.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:30.19,0:01:32.15,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,Yeah, we sure are.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:36.15,0:01:38.17,Default,Classmates,0,0,0,,Ms. Mizuho?
Dialogue: 99,0:01:38.57,0:01:39.92,Default,Classmates,0,0,0,,Are you in here?
Dialogue: 99,0:01:44.29,0:01:46.80,Default,Classmates,0,0,0,,Hey, I was after one of these!
Dialogue: 99,0:01:46.80,0:01:49.59,Default,Classmates,0,0,0,,What do you know, she wears makeup.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:51.29,0:01:55.19,Default,Classmates,0,0,0,,Mine now. I mean, she can order\N anything she wants, regardless of price.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:55.19,0:01:56.31,Default,Classmates,0,0,0,,Even this castle.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:03.53,0:02:07.23,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,It's been a month since we started transmitting an SOS,
Dialogue: 99,0:02:07.23,0:02:10.49,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,but we haven't received any responses,\N let alone been rescued.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:11.13,0:02:12.87,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,We still have internet,
Dialogue: 99,0:02:13.25,0:02:15.89,Default,Pony,0,0,0,,but all web pages are frozen.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:15.89,0:02:18.27,Default,Pony,0,0,0,,Plus we can't send anything to the outside.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:18.27,0:02:21.30,Default,Classmates,0,0,0,,There's still the possibility that someone will come to rescue us, right?
Dialogue: 99,0:02:21.63,0:02:26.26,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,Perhaps. But I believe there's another way to get us back.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:27.23,0:02:30.33,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,Other worlds may provide clues for our return,
Dialogue: 99,0:02:30.33,0:02:33.33,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,or even lead us straight home.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:39.15,0:02:42.28,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,Not long ago, other gateways were discovered,\N thanks to Nagara.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:42.65,0:02:45.05,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,These gateways that he stumbled upon inside the school
Dialogue: 99,0:02:45.05,0:02:47.65,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,led to various other worlds.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:48.28,0:02:53.13,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,However, those worlds are all places that boggle the mind
Dialogue: 99,0:02:53.13,0:02:55.79,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,and reject the presence of us humans.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:58.34,0:03:01.17,Default,Pony,0,0,0,,How does that lead us to a way home?
Dialogue: 99,0:03:01.49,0:03:05.81,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,Good question. First of all,\N here on this island, anything that breaks
Dialogue: 99,0:03:05.81,0:03:07.93,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,stays broken, no matter how long you wait.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:08.73,0:03:10.30,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,But what about over at the school?
Dialogue: 99,0:03:10.91,0:03:13.53,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,In there, if something breaks, if you wait for a little while,
Dialogue: 99,0:03:13.53,0:03:15.91,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,it returns to normal, as if nothing happened.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:16.38,0:03:19.43,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,As a result, we can continue to use the power and water,
Dialogue: 99,0:03:19.43,0:03:21.85,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,and the emergency food supplies are a veritable buffet.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:21.85,0:03:25.95,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,Also, we, along with the school, are in a state of stasis.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:25.95,0:03:28.82,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,So even when we get hurt,\N our wounds are healed before we know it.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:29.93,0:03:33.19,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,Almost as if nothing ever happened.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:33.19,0:03:34.83,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,Which led me to wonder—
Dialogue: 99,0:03:35.27,0:03:37.73,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,the school and the island are totally different worlds,
Dialogue: 99,0:03:37.73,0:03:41.21,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,and the same goes for the {\i1}other{\i0} new worlds that we found.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:43.41,0:03:47.83,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,So maybe the discovery of these worlds is the same phenomenon as what made us drift in the first place.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:48.47,0:03:50.17,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,And if we retrace that phenomenon...
Dialogue: 99,0:03:50.17,0:03:52.85,Default,Narrator,0,0,0,,{\i1}Why did this drift occur?
Dialogue: 99,0:03:54.59,0:03:58.27,Default,Hoshi,0,0,0,,...we'll arrive at what caused all of this?
Dialogue: 99,0:03:58.27,0:03:59.48,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,That's correct.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:59.79,0:04:03.13,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,And before the world sinks, at that.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:11.49,0:04:12.87,Default,Classmates,0,0,0,,Whoa! Ow!
Dialogue: 99,0:04:21.61,0:04:23.38,Default,Hoshi,0,0,0,,Are you okay? Did you get burned?
Dialogue: 99,0:04:24.07,0:04:26.09,Default,Classmates,0,0,0,,No, I'm fine.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:26.51,0:04:29.21,Default,Pony,0,0,0,,Water, somebody! Go get some water!
Dialogue: 99,0:04:29.21,0:04:30.09,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,Oh, right!
Dialogue: 99,0:04:30.59,0:04:32.09,Default,Classmates,0,0,0,,Not this again.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:42.61,0:04:45.39,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,Water! I brought water!
Dialogue: 99,0:04:45.39,0:04:47.40,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,Huh? There's a hole?
Dialogue: 99,0:04:50.35,0:04:53.21,Default,Classmates,0,0,0,,I can't take this. I want to go home.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:54.43,0:04:56.15,Default,Hoshi,0,0,0,,More of that blue fire, huh?
Dialogue: 99,0:04:56.99,0:04:58.91,Default,Hoshi,0,0,0,,Does anyone have any idea what's causing it?
Dialogue: 99,0:05:03.09,0:05:06.17,Default,Hoshi,0,0,0,,We still don't know anything about this island.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:06.93,0:05:10.73,Default,Hoshi,0,0,0,,We need to ensure we take care of ourselves.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:16.63,0:05:19.17,Default,Pony,0,0,0,,Um... Thanks.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:19.17,0:05:21.49,Default,Hoshi,0,0,0,,Sure. No trouble at all.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:34.93,0:05:36.13,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Fugly.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:52.91,0:05:53.89,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 99,0:05:53.89,0:05:54.55,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Uh...
Dialogue: 99,0:05:54.93,0:05:57.63,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,The student council president was wondering if you knew
Dialogue: 99,0:05:57.63,0:05:59.18,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,when those supplies would arrive.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:59.67,0:06:02.33,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Oh, looks like it'll be a little longer.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:02.33,0:06:06.19,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,How much is a little? A day? Three days?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:07.07,0:06:10.19,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,All right, I'll tell her it's three days.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:10.57,0:06:12.45,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Also, there's something else.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:12.45,0:06:13.53,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:13.53,0:06:15.07,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Well, it's just...
Dialogue: 99,0:06:15.53,0:06:17.59,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,earlier, in the woods...
Dialogue: 99,0:06:17.59,0:06:19.83,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,What was that? I can't hear you.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:20.23,0:06:22.27,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Oh, it's nothing.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:22.27,0:06:23.63,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:25.59,0:06:26.17,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:26.47,0:06:29.52,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Tora? Where are you?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:42.17,0:06:42.93,Default,Hayato,0,0,0,,How did we...
Dialogue: 99,0:06:43.37,0:06:45.89,Default,Hayato,0,0,0,,get stuck doing this, anyway?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:45.89,0:06:48.65,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,What choice did we have? There's nothing else to do.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:49.23,0:06:50.17,Default,Hayato,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 99,0:06:50.17,0:06:51.86,Default,Hayato,0,0,0,,Look at that!
Dialogue: 99,0:06:52.13,0:06:53.27,Default,Hayato,0,0,0,,It happened again!
Dialogue: 99,0:06:53.27,0:06:53.93,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,It's on fire.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:53.93,0:06:56.86,Default,Hayato,0,0,0,,Man, this island must have a demon living on it!
Dialogue: 99,0:06:56.86,0:06:58.73,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,You think that's what this is?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:58.73,0:07:00.74,Default,Hayato,0,0,0,,It sure does burn in the weirdest way, huh?
Dialogue: 99,0:07:01.07,0:07:03.62,Default,Hayato,0,0,0,,Do you think it might be someone's power?
Dialogue: 99,0:07:05.50,0:07:07.29,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Mizuho might know something.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:07.29,0:07:08.63,Default,Hayato,0,0,0,,Yeah? How come?
Dialogue: 99,0:07:08.99,0:07:14.07,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,I saw her in the woods earlier,\N standing in front of a burning tree.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:14.07,0:07:15.99,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,It was this same kind of blue fire.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:15.99,0:07:17.53,Default,Hayato,0,0,0,,Are you for real?
Dialogue: 99,0:07:17.53,0:07:20.64,Default,Classmates,0,0,0,,Fire! Fire!
Dialogue: 99,0:07:21.83,0:07:23.07,Default,Hayato,0,0,0,,Rajdhani!
Dialogue: 99,0:07:23.07,0:07:24.09,Default,Hayato,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 99,0:07:24.09,0:07:25.15,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 99,0:07:28.05,0:07:28.73,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,Is this...
Dialogue: 99,0:07:31.59,0:07:34.27,Default,Classmates,0,0,0,,I bet Mizuho is doing this.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:34.27,0:07:34.99,Default,Hayato,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 99,0:07:34.27,0:07:34.99,Alt Styling,Nagara,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 99,0:07:35.27,0:07:36.61,Default,Classmates,0,0,0,,I mean, everything that's burning
Dialogue: 99,0:07:36.61,0:07:39.33,Default,Classmates,0,0,0,,is stuff that Mizuho's power has produced, right?
Dialogue: 99,0:07:39.33,0:07:40.16,Default,Hayato,0,0,0,,That's true.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:40.43,0:07:43.57,Default,Hayato,0,0,0,,Now that you mention it,\N those tools that started burning were also...
Dialogue: 99,0:07:44.25,0:07:48.59,Default,Hayato,0,0,0,,And you were just saying that you saw Mizuho burning a tree in the forest!
Dialogue: 99,0:07:48.59,0:07:49.57,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,No, I said—
Dialogue: 99,0:07:49.57,0:07:50.58,Default,Classmates,0,0,0,,Huh? What's that about?
Dialogue: 99,0:07:50.89,0:07:54.99,Default,Hayato,0,0,0,,He said he saw it for himself! Mizuho gave this hard glare,
Dialogue: 99,0:07:54.99,0:07:58.59,Default,Hayato,0,0,0,,and bam! This tree just caught fire!\N And it was a blue fire, at that!
Dialogue: 99,0:07:58.59,0:08:00.18,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,No, I didn't. What I said was—
Dialogue: 99,0:08:00.18,0:08:01.55,Default,Classmates,0,0,0,,That settles it, then!
Dialogue: 99,0:08:01.55,0:08:05.09,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,You can't tell anything by just that. We have to verify it.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:05.09,0:08:06.56,Default,Classmates,0,0,0,,I'll go tell the others.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:06.56,0:08:10.31,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Uh, wait...
Dialogue: 99,0:08:24.83,0:08:25.81,Default,Hoshi,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:25.81,0:08:26.95,Default,Pony,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:26.95,0:08:29.07,Default,Hoshi,0,0,0,,Info on the message board users.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:29.07,0:08:30.83,Default,Pony,0,0,0,,Huh? How did you get this?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:30.83,0:08:34.59,Default,Pony,0,0,0,,I asked my grandpa's lawyer,\N and had him file a disclosure request.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:35.51,0:08:37.45,Default,Hoshi,0,0,0,,I took a look...
Dialogue: 99,0:08:37.45,0:08:39.82,Default,Hoshi,0,0,0,,and here she is, from our class.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:52.43,0:08:54.11,Default,Teachers,0,0,0,,What's up?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:54.11,0:08:56.45,Default,Teachers,0,0,0,,You have a pretty intense look on your face.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:56.45,0:08:59.11,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,I just can't let this go.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:00.67,0:09:04.47,Default,Teachers,0,0,0,,Well, there were extenuating\N circumstances—on both sides.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:04.47,0:09:06.12,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,That's just hand-waving it.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:06.53,0:09:10.62,Default,Teachers,0,0,0,,There are times when just being right isn't always for the best.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:10.62,0:09:14.39,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Still... I don't like it.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:14.39,0:09:15.50,Default,Teachers,0,0,0,,In that case...
Dialogue: 99,0:09:16.27,0:09:18.76,Default,Teachers,0,0,0,,maybe it's a good thing you're still a child.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:23.53,0:09:25.01,Default,Teachers,0,0,0,,I suppose.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:25.47,0:09:29.27,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Tora! Where are you?! Tora!
Dialogue: 99,0:09:38.81,0:09:39.78,Default,Pony,0,0,0,,Can we have a moment?
Dialogue: 99,0:09:42.33,0:09:45.65,Default,Pony,0,0,0,,You're the one who's been\N posting about me, aren't you?
Dialogue: 99,0:09:45.65,0:09:46.78,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 99,0:09:47.17,0:09:51.29,Default,Pony,0,0,0,,Denying it won't help you.\N We have proof that you're the one behind it.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:52.41,0:09:55.17,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Wow, that's the privileged class for you.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:55.47,0:09:57.03,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,You operate differently, all right.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:57.03,0:09:58.77,Default,Pony,0,0,0,,Retract what you said, right now!
Dialogue: 99,0:09:58.77,0:10:00.11,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 99,0:10:00.11,0:10:03.61,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,It's the truth, isn't it?\N What's wrong with stating facts?
Dialogue: 99,0:10:03.61,0:10:06.39,Default,Pony,0,0,0,,Huh? How can you shrug this off?!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:06.39,0:10:11.07,Default,Hoshi,0,0,0,,I wonder if he knows that you used the library's Wi-Fi
Dialogue: 99,0:10:11.07,0:10:13.69,Default,Hoshi,0,0,0,,to slander one of your fellow students.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:14.57,0:10:16.06,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,He has nothing to do with this.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:16.57,0:10:20.07,Default,Hoshi,0,0,0,,You say that—but as a teacher, he's still liable.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:22.07,0:10:26.05,Default,Hoshi,0,0,0,,Why don't you apologize to the student council president?
Dialogue: 99,0:10:26.05,0:10:26.81,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,—t up...
Dialogue: 99,0:10:26.81,0:10:29.07,Default,Pony,0,0,0,,What's that? I can't hear you.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:29.07,0:10:32.20,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,I didn't do anything wrong. {\i1}You{\i0} apologize to everyone!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:33.60,0:10:35.13,Default,Pony,0,0,0,,Are you...
Dialogue: 99,0:10:38.19,0:10:41.57,Default,Classmates,0,0,0,,What's this? Those blue fires are Mizuho's power?
Dialogue: 99,0:10:41.57,0:10:43.99,Default,Classmates,0,0,0,,Yeah, I heard it was a curse she invoked.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:43.99,0:10:46.09,Default,Classmates,0,0,0,,None of us understand what she's thinking.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:46.47,0:10:47.93,Default,Classmates,0,0,0,,It's scary.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:05.79,0:11:06.91,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,Whatcha up to?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:11.49,0:11:12.62,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,It's too late.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:13.81,0:11:16.23,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,There's... nothing we can do.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:27.23,0:11:29.29,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,This is the same as the first day.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:29.29,0:11:30.51,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:30.51,0:11:33.26,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,That day, when we first started drifting,
Dialogue: 99,0:11:33.59,0:11:35.39,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,you left another bird to die.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:51.37,0:11:53.53,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Well, I was in a hurry...
Dialogue: 99,0:11:54.05,0:11:57.23,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Besides, they say it's not good to do anything if you don't know what you're doing.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:57.23,0:11:58.21,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,So?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:59.07,0:12:03.95,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,You're right. I just let it die\N because I'm a heartless person.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:03.95,0:12:05.26,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Is that what you want to hear?
Dialogue: 99,0:12:05.26,0:12:06.63,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,That's not true.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:07.83,0:12:10.24,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,What do you know? You talk like you know everything.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:11.73,0:12:14.43,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,I didn't say anything then...
Dialogue: 99,0:12:15.01,0:12:17.03,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,but is being abandoned by someone
Dialogue: 99,0:12:17.03,0:12:18.94,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,any reason for abandoning someone else?
Dialogue: 99,0:12:30.27,0:12:30.99,Default,Hoshi,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:31.37,0:12:32.87,Default,Hoshi,0,0,0,,Good to see you.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:33.31,0:12:35.49,Default,Hoshi,0,0,0,,We have a question for you. Would you mind?
Dialogue: 99,0:12:37.73,0:12:39.29,Default,Hoshi,0,0,0,,Are you behind the blue fires?
Dialogue: 99,0:12:41.49,0:12:43.25,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,That's ridiculous.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:43.73,0:12:46.91,Default,Hoshi,0,0,0,,I'm only asking this for your sake.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:46.91,0:12:49.07,Default,Hoshi,0,0,0,,To give you a chance to earn back our trust—
Dialogue: 99,0:12:49.07,0:12:49.87,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 99,0:12:49.87,0:12:54.15,Default,Hoshi,0,0,0,,Look, we don't want you to have a repeat of the mishap with Cap.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:54.76,0:12:57.49,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Don't you group me in with that brute!
Dialogue: 99,0:12:57.49,0:13:00.14,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,I'm sick and tired of your lies!
Dialogue: 99,0:13:00.49,0:13:02.93,Default,Hoshi,0,0,0,,Why won't you understand?
Dialogue: 99,0:13:02.93,0:13:05.90,Default,Hoshi,0,0,0,,We just want to protect you, that's all.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:17.41,0:13:20.59,Default,Hoshi,0,0,0,,Unless you change your ways,\N that's what's going to happen.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:24.47,0:13:25.54,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,Did you figure anything out?
Dialogue: 99,0:13:25.83,0:13:27.61,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,Hey, perfect timing.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:28.43,0:13:29.49,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 99,0:13:29.49,0:13:31.87,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,That there's a "PocketGame".
Dialogue: 99,0:13:31.87,0:13:33.85,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,It's a portable game device from way back.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:33.85,0:13:37.56,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,I got it from Mizuho in exchange for some toys I made for her.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:38.21,0:13:40.77,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,It's the only thing that didn't burn up in the fire earlier,
Dialogue: 99,0:13:40.77,0:13:42.31,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,which intrigued me, and got me thinking.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:42.95,0:13:46.51,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,What's the difference between what burned,\N and what didn't burn?
Dialogue: 99,0:13:46.51,0:13:48.71,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,Hmm... So what is it?
Dialogue: 99,0:13:48.71,0:13:51.93,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,It's probably whether it was traded for, or taken.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:51.93,0:13:52.97,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 99,0:13:52.97,0:13:57.99,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,This was something that was exchanged in a fair trade between Mizuho and me,
Dialogue: 99,0:13:57.99,0:14:01.17,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,but the rest of it was stuff I got from Mizuho without compensation.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:01.17,0:14:02.95,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,You're talking cash, right?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:02.95,0:14:04.00,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:04.00,0:14:06.69,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,Ah, yes. How would you like this special item?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:06.69,0:14:08.75,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,Huh? You're asking me {\i1}now{\i0}?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:08.75,0:14:10.21,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,Come on, just take it.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:11.90,0:14:12.59,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,Okay...
Dialogue: 99,0:14:19.49,0:14:21.61,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,O-Ow, hot...
Dialogue: 99,0:14:24.33,0:14:25.06,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,It's all right.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:25.79,0:14:30.95,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,This fire just {\i1}feels{\i0} hot—it doesn't do us any harm.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:30.95,0:14:31.85,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:31.85,0:14:36.53,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,And so, Mizuho's things aren't all that burn.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:36.53,0:14:39.20,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,I made that toy using {\i1}my {\i0}power.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:39.71,0:14:40.45,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 99,0:14:40.97,0:14:43.29,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,the fires aren't Mizuho's fault after all, huh?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:43.29,0:14:44.08,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:44.45,0:14:47.83,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,So is this another of this world's rules?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:47.83,0:14:49.13,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,Most likely.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:49.13,0:14:53.26,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,There are still many unknown elements in play,\N and I can't say anything for certain.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:53.26,0:14:53.97,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,Then again...
Dialogue: 99,0:14:54.49,0:14:58.41,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,I'd say I've deduced that Mizuho isn't the culprit here.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:58.41,0:15:01.49,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,But even still, I wish she would come out and say so herself.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:01.49,0:15:03.56,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,We're all too dependent.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:04.05,0:15:07.06,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,Both on her, and on this world.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:08.11,0:15:09.31,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Tora!
Dialogue: 99,0:15:09.89,0:15:12.07,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Are you back yet? Hello?
Dialogue: 99,0:15:13.07,0:15:14.07,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 99,0:15:14.07,0:15:16.15,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,That's Tora's dish.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:21.07,0:15:21.83,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,He...
Dialogue: 99,0:15:24.08,0:15:27.51,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,still doesn't know anything.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:27.51,0:15:29.83,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,He can't live on his own yet.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:31.91,0:15:33.95,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Just like me...
Dialogue: 99,0:15:53.35,0:15:54.82,Default,Hoshi,0,0,0,,If you'll just show sincere remorse
Dialogue: 99,0:15:54.82,0:15:58.25,Default,Hoshi,0,0,0,,and offer an apology for everything you've done up to now,
Dialogue: 99,0:15:58.25,0:16:00.12,Default,Hoshi,0,0,0,,we will forgive you.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:01.73,0:16:05.33,Default,Hoshi,0,0,0,,Why don't we all work together to rise above this difficult situation?
Dialogue: 99,0:16:06.03,0:16:09.58,Default,Hoshi,0,0,0,,We'll give you until noon tomorrow. Think about it.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:11.63,0:16:13.84,Default,Pony,0,0,0,,What did you see earlier?
Dialogue: 99,0:16:14.81,0:16:17.67,Default,Pony,0,0,0,,You're going to lose someone dear to you again by doing this.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:18.84,0:16:22.22,Default,Pony,0,0,0,,It's such a simple thing. Just one phrase.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:22.22,0:16:23.72,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,I know that!
Dialogue: 99,0:16:28.31,0:16:29.69,Default,Pony,0,0,0,,If you'd just said it,
Dialogue: 99,0:16:29.69,0:16:32.19,Default,Pony,0,0,0,,you wouldn't have lost him.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:45.51,0:16:47.83,Default,Hayato,0,0,0,,Come on, you gotta be quick before it's all gone!
Dialogue: 99,0:16:47.83,0:16:50.63,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Nah, I'm good. You can have this one too.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:50.63,0:16:51.87,Default,Hayato,0,0,0,,Huh? You sure?
Dialogue: 99,0:16:52.19,0:16:54.45,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Yeah. There isn't really anything I want anyway.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:54.45,0:16:56.55,Default,Hayato,0,0,0,,Thanks! You're a great guy, huh?
Dialogue: 99,0:16:56.55,0:16:58.93,Default,Hayato,0,0,0,,Oh, and no take backs—
Dialogue: 99,0:16:58.93,0:16:59.97,Default,Hayato,0,0,0,,Ow!
Dialogue: 99,0:16:59.97,0:17:01.84,Default,Hayato,0,0,0,,My money!
Dialogue: 99,0:17:01.84,0:17:05.72,Default,Hayato,0,0,0,,Hot! Hot!
Dialogue: 99,0:17:11.41,0:17:12.83,Default,Classmates,0,0,0,,Mizuho is behind this!
Dialogue: 99,0:17:12.83,0:17:13.95,Default,Classmates,0,0,0,,We should get rid of her!
Dialogue: 99,0:17:13.95,0:17:16.63,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,I'm telling you, she isn't the one doing this!
Dialogue: 99,0:17:16.63,0:17:20.36,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,These fires are part of the island's rules,\N and if we pay for things, they won't burn up!
Dialogue: 99,0:17:23.47,0:17:26.87,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,In any case, we have to do\N something about this, and fast.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:31.23,0:17:32.87,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,That's Mizuho's cat.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:33.55,0:17:33.99,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:33.99,0:17:34.99,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,Catnapping?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:34.99,0:17:36.09,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 99,0:17:36.53,0:17:39.46,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,He's hurt, and in bad shape.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:39.46,0:17:42.39,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,Oh yeah? And what have you done with the real Nagara?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:43.83,0:17:47.72,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,It's my fault that everyone is distrustful of Mizuho.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:50.33,0:17:51.31,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:51.31,0:17:51.91,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:51.91,0:17:54.31,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,Let's take him back to Mizuho.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:55.41,0:17:56.73,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,How do we do that?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:56.73,0:17:57.82,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,We run.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:58.61,0:18:00.07,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,Fast as we can.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:10.67,0:18:13.35,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,They're all a bunch of liars.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:14.04,0:18:15.05,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,There she is!
Dialogue: 99,0:18:18.07,0:18:19.67,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,Ow!
Dialogue: 99,0:18:20.29,0:18:21.21,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 99,0:18:23.97,0:18:26.01,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,It's all my fault...
Dialogue: 99,0:18:26.99,0:18:28.80,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,that everyone is blaming you.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:28.80,0:18:32.52,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Because I said something misleading, they all...
Dialogue: 99,0:18:32.87,0:18:36.44,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Not really. They would have started to blame me sooner or later.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:38.55,0:18:39.19,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Even so...
Dialogue: 99,0:18:40.97,0:18:41.81,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:50.83,0:18:52.16,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Oh yeah...
Dialogue: 99,0:18:54.21,0:18:56.99,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Your cat was in the woods, unable to move.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:59.61,0:19:01.05,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Thank goodness.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:05.49,0:19:08.97,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,Hey, so how long are you planning on sulking?
Dialogue: 99,0:19:09.72,0:19:13.47,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,You're not burning everything, right?\N Why don't you speak up already and—
Dialogue: 99,0:19:13.47,0:19:17.40,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,I know! I've known I should since all this started!
Dialogue: 99,0:19:19.55,0:19:24.41,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,It's just that there wasn't\N anything I could do by myself.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:49.47,0:19:52.26,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,Well, we can't live here anymore, can we?
Dialogue: 99,0:20:01.43,0:20:02.40,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,It turns out...
Dialogue: 99,0:20:04.67,0:20:06.97,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,we aren't able to change the world after all.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:09.63,0:20:11.65,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,So it's okay.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:12.61,0:20:13.61,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:14.66,0:20:16.83,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,The island's gone back to the way it was before?
Dialogue: 99,0:20:16.83,0:20:18.54,Default,Asakaze,0,0,0,,What's going on here?
Dialogue: 99,0:20:18.85,0:20:21.67,Default,Hayato,0,0,0,,Awesome! Leave it to Asakaze!
Dialogue: 99,0:20:26.71,0:20:27.67,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,All the fires...
Dialogue: 99,0:20:28.09,0:20:29.75,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,were not caused by me.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:32.75,0:20:33.68,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Although...
Dialogue: 99,0:20:34.05,0:20:37.65,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,I was the one who made it rain money,\N and set the island on fire.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:37.65,0:20:38.81,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Huh? You were?
Dialogue: 99,0:20:38.81,0:20:40.56,Default,Hayato,0,0,0,,Are you serious?!
Dialogue: 99,0:20:40.56,0:20:45.77,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,So for that much, at least, I'll apologize. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:47.32,0:20:47.82,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 99,0:20:49.31,0:20:52.70,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,the rest of it isn't my fault, okay? Absolutely not!
Dialogue: 99,0:20:58.05,0:21:00.21,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,So let's review...
Dialogue: 99,0:21:00.75,0:21:04.53,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,What happens if you get something on this island without paying for it?
Dialogue: 99,0:21:07.13,0:21:07.96,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,Ow!
Dialogue: 99,0:21:08.73,0:21:11.09,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,It burns up. We don't know why.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:11.77,0:21:13.81,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,But as long as that's the way it works,
Dialogue: 99,0:21:13.58,0:21:14.37,Default,Hayato,0,0,0,,{\an8}Hey...
Dialogue: 99,0:21:13.81,0:21:16.10,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,we have to accept it, and live with it.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:17.07,0:21:19.81,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,So today, I'm announcing a revolutionary new app,
Dialogue: 99,0:21:19.81,0:21:22.10,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,which will allow us to adapt to life in this world.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:23.11,0:21:25.03,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hyo{\i0}-ryu-coin!
Dialogue: 99,0:21:27.25,0:21:30.11,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,This is an electronic payment service
Dialogue: 99,0:21:30.11,0:21:34.15,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,that allows you to create ledgers,\N and make asset transactions over the internet.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:34.15,0:21:37.12,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,By using this, we won't be\N transgressing the island's rules.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:37.43,0:21:40.87,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,We'll be able to exchange goods without having them catch fire.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:55.63,0:21:56.97,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Here, for you.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:58.41,0:21:59.25,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 99,0:22:07.39,0:22:10.19,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,To thank you for saving my cat.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:11.53,0:22:13.09,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,U-Um,
Dialogue: 99,0:22:13.09,0:22:15.03,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,we have to settle it. How much?
Dialogue: 99,0:22:17.39,0:22:18.16,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:19.69,0:22:22.66,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,It's a present, after all.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:28.27,0:22:30.69,Default,Asakaze,0,0,0,,So what do we do now?
Dialogue: 99,0:22:31.55,0:22:35.07,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,I wasn't expecting this world to go back to the way it was, too.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:35.07,0:22:36.55,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,I, uh...
Dialogue: 99,0:22:37.31,0:22:39.56,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,I can see the way out.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:39.56,0:22:41.97,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,Huh? Just like...
Dialogue: 99,0:22:41.97,0:22:44.81,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,Yeah. The place we're supposed to go home to.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:44.81,0:22:48.23,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,I thought I could just about reach out and touch it...
Dialogue: 99,0:22:48.23,0:22:53.99,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,but right now, it's just a pinpoint, far away.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:57.27,0:23:00.95,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,"Compass". That's my power.
